"                <li>mistakes or updating in references</li>\n"
"              </ul>\n"
"            </dd>\n"
"            <dd>All requests for correction must clearly state where they should be implemented in the document (page number, paragraph and line) and specify both the old (wrong) version and the correction.</dd>\n"
